### Visitor: search and view cars without logging in
### Start the server first: .\kotlin.bat run -m server

### All active cars
GET http://localhost:8080/api/cars

### Only electric cars in Breda
GET http://localhost:8080/api/cars?type=BEV&city=Breda

### Cars with a maximum hourly rate of 7 euro
GET http://localhost:8080/api/cars?maxHourlyRate=7

### The details of one car
GET http://localhost:8080/api/cars/1

### A car that does not exist (404)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/cars/999
